      "writtenOn": "2019-05-03T02:00:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes fair question. How about:\n\n- move DMEM_ecc and make it an opaque structure\n- provide utility functions to write into DMEM_ecc, implement these in assembly to guarantee word writes\n\nWe can do the same for other structs that are used to write to the dcrypto peripheral.\n\nI can put together a CL today to see what this would look like\n\nAdditionally, we should add some known answer tests",
