      "message": "not sure what you\u0027re asking?\n\nYes, pEcc-\u003ernd needs some uncorrelated random value, and no, pEcc-\u003ernd does not need wiping after use.\nAnd yes, pEcc-\u003ed and -\u003ek get overwritten (i.e. wiped) with this uncorrelated random.",
